<title>USA: Chase Manhattan redeeming preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan redeeming preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp said it will redeem all outstanding shares of its 9.08 percent cumulative preferred stock at a redemption price of $25 per share on March 31.</p>
<p>Chase said dividends will cease to accrue from, and after, that date.</p>
